      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nAdds a TP=2 Mamba2 prefix-cache regression using `Zyphra/Zamba2-1.2B-instruct`, addressing the “Test TP>1 behaviour” work item in #26201 for align mode.\r\n\r\nThe test runs cold, warm, and cache-read-bypassed requests in one engine. It requires a non-empty warm cache hit, verifies zero cached tokens for cold and bypass requests, and compares warm versus bypass output token IDs and chosen-token logprobs at every generated position.\r\n\r\nUses the existing two-GPU distributed test marker and CI lane. Coverage is limited to this Mamba2 hybrid model with TP=2 and the default align mode. No production code or CI configuration changes.\r\n\r\nDuplicate-work checks found no equivalent open regression test. #45575 addresses block-size alignment, while #56291 reorganizes the existing hybrid tests.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nRun the targeted test on two GPUs:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4,5 VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0 \\\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/models/language/generation/test_hybrid.py::test_zamba2_mamba2_align_apc_tp2_cache_hit \\\r\n  -v -s\r\n```\r\n\r\nRun static checks:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nruff check tests/models/language/generation/test_hybrid.py\r\nruff format --check tests/models/language/generation/test_hybrid.py\r\n```\r\n\r\nVerify collection under the existing CI selector:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest --collect-only -q \\\r\n  tests/models/language/generation/test_hybrid.py::test_zamba2_mamba2_align_apc_tp2_cache_hit \\\r\n  -m 'distributed(num_gpus=2)'\r\n```\r\n\r\nCheck test sensitivity by temporarily disabling prefix-cache reads for the warm request. This mutation is not included in the patch.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n- Targeted pytest passed on 2× NVIDIA L20: `1 passed, 14 warnings in 60.49s`, with no skips.\r\n- Logs confirmed `Zamba2ForCausalLM`, TP=2, and align cache mode.\r\n- A separate metrics run recorded cold/warm/bypass cached tokens of `0 / 2016 / 0`, matching output token IDs at all 16 positions, and a maximum chosen-token logprob difference of `0.0`.\r\n- The temporary cache-read mutation failed at the non-empty-hit assertion.\r\n- Ruff check and format check passed.\r\n- The new test was collected by the two-GPU distributed selector.\r\n\r\nLocal validation used Python source at `8b365ff94926` with native core/MoE libraries built from `c9611215195e`. Compilation and CUDA graphs remained enabled. ",
